ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Chiaroscuro
Board: /styles/chiaroscuro
Companions: chiaroscuro-starter.html, chiaroscuro-study.ai, chiaroscuro-study.psd

Artboards
1. A dark room, 3000 × 2000 px. Ground #070707, not charcoal.
2. One warm beam from the upper left. A single invented figure, partly in the beam, partly gone.
3. A small label, plain sans: "one source."

Rules
- No fill light and no rim light.
- Do not outline the figure. The boundary is where the light stops.
- Lit flesh #d7c4a8, one cloth note #8d1f2a.
- Do not reproduce any existing painting.
